WEBVTT

00:02:57.794 --> 00:03:00.204
SRK: Ok. You have to promise,
when you crack this

00:03:00.204 --> 00:03:02.724
you will come here on
Ted Talks India the first thing.

00:03:02.724 --> 00:03:05.514
First time we get teleported,
you get teleported here.

00:03:05.514 --> 00:03:08.124
(Applause)

00:03:09.604 --> 00:03:14.674
A question that every Indian
would like to ask,

00:03:14.674 --> 00:03:18.815
I will meet Sundar 
and ask him this question:

00:03:18.815 --> 00:03:21.495
You are in a unique position
of being an Indian

00:03:21.495 --> 00:03:25.225
who grew up and lived in India,

00:03:25.225 --> 00:03:28.535
and are now leading change 
and innovation for the whole world.

00:03:28.535 --> 00:03:34.345
There is nobody else
who can answer this question for us.